# The Dawning Archaic, {10}: "This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard." On turn 1 Bot1
# casts Faithless Looting (a sorcery) discarding Lightning Strike and Duress, and Lightning Bolt (an instant), so four cards count;
# the Black Lotus sacrificed on turn 3 is an artifact and counts for nothing, and neither does the Shock Bot2 cast on turn 2 from
# its own graveyard. On turn 3 Bot1 taps seven red mana (four Mox Rubies and the Lotus) and the Archaic costs {6}, so one red
# mana is left in the pool (a reduction of 4, not 5 which would leave two, nor 3 which would leave none). It has Reach.

